                <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[40px] font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-5">
                    The Legacy Of Quality Education Since 1996
                </h2>
                <div class="font-lato space-y-4 text-sm md:text-[14px] text-[#1E1E1E]/85 leading-relaxed text-justify sm:text-left">
                    <p>
                        Established in 1996, Bethsada Public School stands as a testament to the Guardian Angel Society and commitment to providing accessible and high-quality education to the rural communities surrounding Vengola and Perumbavoor. As the pioneering institution founded under the society, Bethsada Public School has cultivated a rich legacy of academic excellence and holistic development.
                    </p>
                   
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Image: Bleeds to Right Screen Edge with Left Arch Curve -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-[52%] xl:w-[54%] shrink-0" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="900">
            <div class="w-full h-72 sm:h-96 md:h-[460px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-l-[130px] sm:rounded-l-[190px] lg:rounded-l-[250px] rounded-r-none overflow-hidden shadow-xl bg-[#FAF0DE]">
                <img src="/images/Welcoming-Bethsada-School-Morning.png"
                     alt="Clinical Services - Compassionate Caregiver Connection"
                     class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105" />
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ================= BLOCK 2: REHABILITATION AND RECOVERY PROGRAMS (LEFT BLEED, RIGHT CURVE) ================= -->
    <div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-10 lg:gap-16">

        <!-- Left Image: Bleeds to Left Screen Edge with Right Arch Curve -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-[52%] xl:w-[54%] shrink-0" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="900">
            <div class="w-full h-72 sm:h-96 md:h-[460px] lg:h-[520px] rounded-r-[130px] sm:rounded-r-[190px] lg:rounded-r-[250px] rounded-l-none overflow-hidden shadow-xl bg-[#FAF0DE]">
                <img src="/images/Bethsada School Assembly Hall.png"
                     alt="Rehabilitation and Recovery Programs Montage"
                     class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105" />
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Content Column -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-[48%] xl:w-[46%] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-0 lg:pr-12 xl:pr-28 shrink-0" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="900" data-aos-delay="150">
            <div class="max-w-xl">
                <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[40px] font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-5">
                    Our History
                </h2>

                <div class="font-lato space-y-3.5 text-sm md:text-[14px] text-[#1E1E1E]/85 leading-relaxed text-justify sm:text-left">
                    <p>
                        Established in 1996, Bethsada Public School is a prestigious educational institution functioning under the guidance of the Guardian Angel Care Charitable Society. The society is chaired by H. G. Dr. Abraham Mar Severious Metropolitan, whose visionary leadership and commitment to social upliftment played a significant role in shaping the institution.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Founded with the noble mission of empowering the rural community through quality and value-based education, the school was established in response to the growing need for a holistic learning environment in the region. The institution is affiliated with the Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE), New Delhi, and has steadily evolved into a center of academic excellence, discipline, and character formation.
                    </p>
                   
                   

                    <p class="pt-1">

                        The need to establish a school under the society was conceived from a feeling that quality education shall not remain the privilege of urban populace. Those who are in rural areas too shall be given such openings keeping the cost affordable. And Bethsada Public School came up as Society's next endeavor at Vengola, a village 5 km close to Perumbavoor. The School offers CBSE curriculum and since the last one and a half decade, has turned out to be the pride for this village as a media of transformation and renewal
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= ORIGIN & VISION WITH VALUE ICONS ================= -->
<section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden border-b border-black/5">
